1
00:00:02,035 --> 00:00:06,720
Lord Orochimaru gave us an important task
to take care of when we reach this point.

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:11,540
I'm afraid you're going to have to die
just this once.

3
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,400
I must die?

4
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:14,510
This once?

5
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:18,120
You will take one of these... awakening
pills.

6
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,820
And just what'll happen after that?

7
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,260
Not to worry, Sasuke.

8
00:00:25,885 --> 00:00:27,860
Why do you think that we're all here?

9
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:31,700
We'll cast a barrier ninjutsu to minimize
the transition.

10
00:00:32,219 --> 00:00:35,460
Instead of dying, you'll only be suspended
in a state of half-death.

11
00:00:36,859 --> 00:00:38,140
One thing's for sure.

12
00:00:38,819 --> 00:00:40,420
I can't afford to die.

13
00:00:41,379 --> 00:00:42,379
Not yet.

14
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,280
All right, then.

15
00:00:51,335 --> 00:00:52,335
Now!

16
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,560
Four Black Mists Formation!

17
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:04,280
And now, Black Seal!

18
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:07,820
There.

19
00:01:07,990 --> 00:01:08,990
That'll hold him for now.

20
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,980
You're weak, Sasuke.

21
00:01:15,505 --> 00:01:16,660
Damn it!

22
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:12,580
A little pause... and we are back.

23
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:43,220
A little pause... and we are back.

24
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,340
I see.

25
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,200
You've made up your mind, then?

26
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:56,940
Yes.

27
00:02:57,200 --> 00:03:00,740
I have already been carrying out fitness
training to prepare for the surgery.

28
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:03,780
I will return to action as soon as I can
after I heal.

29
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:16,980
Lee.

30
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:18,340
Yes, ma'am.

31
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,360
What is it?

32
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:21,920
You can quit as a shinobi.

33
00:03:22,485 --> 00:03:23,620
It won't kill you, you know.

34
00:03:28,235 --> 00:03:29,235
What is it with you?

35
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,550
Why are you so fixated on being a shinobi?

36
00:03:34,850 --> 00:03:36,410
It is everything to me.

37
00:03:36,945 --> 00:03:38,912
I must prove that with
enough heart, even

38
00:03:38,913 --> 00:03:41,891
someone with my faults
can become a real ninja!

39
00:03:43,550 --> 00:03:45,270
But it's important you realize.

40
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:48,070
There is still a chance that you could
die.

41
00:03:48,071 --> 00:03:49,490
Even so.

42
00:03:50,830 --> 00:03:51,950
That's a promise.

43
00:03:52,890 --> 00:03:54,210
It is my dream.

44
00:03:54,350 --> 00:03:55,350
What can I say?

45
00:03:58,770 --> 00:03:59,730
Tell me.

46
00:03:59,790 --> 00:04:02,410
What makes you so touchy about Hokage?

47
00:04:03,170 --> 00:04:05,670
It's because unlike you, that's my goal!

48
00:04:05,950 --> 00:04:09,130
Just watch, because someday I will be the
Hokage!

49
00:04:09,450 --> 00:04:10,910
To be Hokage.

50
00:04:10,970 --> 00:04:12,630
That is my dream!

51
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:15,370
Hmm.

52
00:04:15,371 --> 00:04:18,050
Such ambitious children seem to come from
this world.

53
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:19,070
From this village.

54
00:04:22,770 --> 00:04:26,550
Sarutobi-sensei, I can see you were a
magnificent Hokage.

55
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:29,930
The surgery is this afternoon.

56
00:04:30,250 --> 00:04:31,370
You should prepare yourself.

57
00:04:32,590 --> 00:04:33,590
Let's go, Lee.

58
00:04:33,730 --> 00:04:34,910
Are you ready for this?

59
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,430
Yes, ma'am!

60
00:04:46,370 --> 00:04:47,370
I'm exhausted.

61
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:51,631
Who would have ever guessed that this mission
would turn out to be such a tough one?

62
00:04:55,370 --> 00:04:56,370
Shhhh.

63
00:04:57,820 --> 00:04:59,710
Stay here while we check it out.

64
00:05:00,470 --> 00:05:01,670
Raido, come on.

65
00:05:02,210 --> 00:05:03,210
Right.

66
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:12,310
Great.

67
00:05:12,490 --> 00:05:13,910
It looks like we've got company.

68
00:05:15,050 --> 00:05:16,050
There's just one.

69
00:05:16,890 --> 00:05:18,150
No, wait, two of them.

70
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,390
Get ready!

71
00:05:22,490 --> 00:05:23,730
You've finally found your home!

72
00:05:24,490 --> 00:05:26,541
You've found your home, and you know
you've got to go.

73
00:05:26,565 --> 00:05:32,440
All right, then.

74
00:05:32,441 --> 00:05:34,060
They work for Orochimaru.

75
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:37,840
And judging from the path
these four are taking, I guess

76
00:05:37,841 --> 00:05:40,261
they've just come from the
village hidden in the leaves.

77
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:48,690
What you got in the coffin?

78
00:05:50,670 --> 00:05:52,490
Fighting two Jonin at once?

79
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,230
I'm trembling at the prospect.

80
00:06:07,180 --> 00:06:08,840
They all have curse marks.

81
00:06:10,020 --> 00:06:11,960
You might want to think this over.

82
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:15,860
It won't be like last time when you jumped
us all by surprise.

83
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,600
Yeah, you're right, scum.

84
00:06:17,700 --> 00:06:19,280
You won't survive this time.

85
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,620
Trust me, you pawns of Orochimaru.

86
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:26,840
You don't want to mess with the Leaf
Shinobi.

87
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:36,980
Where are they?

88
00:06:37,670 --> 00:06:38,670
It's been too long.

89
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,640
So you think maybe something's happened to
them?

90
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:44,010
Let's go find out.

91
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,040
Right.

92
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:54,420
Akamaru?

93
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,560
What's the matter with him?

94
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,200
He smells blood.

95
00:06:58,860 --> 00:07:00,260
Somewhere nearby.

96
00:07:02,605 --> 00:07:03,860
What happened?

97
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,400
Aido!

98
00:07:11,330 --> 00:07:11,930
Genma!

99
00:07:11,931 --> 00:07:12,931
Genma!

100
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:23,790
This isn't good.

101
00:07:29,110 --> 00:07:30,110
All

102
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:49,400
I can do right now is just try and
stabilize him.

103
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:51,320
I'm going, Shizune.

104
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:55,020
I'm going to find them and make them pay.

105
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,380
No, you won't!

106
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:57,220
What?

107
00:07:57,540 --> 00:07:58,540
What do you mean?

108
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:01,300
She's right, Iwashi.

109
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:05,280
They... they were using jutsu.

110
00:08:05,281 --> 00:08:08,660
Beyond the powers of mere shinobi.

111
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:14,480
If you go after them, you'll only be
killed.

112
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,640
Genma, that's enough talking.

113
00:08:29,370 --> 00:08:30,390
Here's what happened.

114
00:08:30,470 --> 00:08:34,250
The scent of two newcomers converged on
the scent of Sasuke and four others.

115
00:08:34,470 --> 00:08:37,669
The two have stayed behind while Sasuke's
group has moved on.

116
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:38,830
So what now?

117
00:08:39,090 --> 00:08:40,309
Just as I thought.

118
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:42,809
Sasuke's got an escort.

119
00:08:42,810 --> 00:08:45,990
Man, this is turning out to be such a
drag.

120
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:47,510
There's no question!

121
00:08:47,690 --> 00:08:49,070
We gotta go after Sasuke!

122
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:51,050
Who died and made you boss?

123
00:08:51,350 --> 00:08:54,470
Last time I checked, Shikamaru was in
charge of running this show.

124
00:08:54,610 --> 00:08:55,670
It's up to him to decide.

125
00:08:56,190 --> 00:08:56,510
Hmph!

126
00:08:56,970 --> 00:08:58,170
Well, Shikamaru...

127
00:08:59,050 --> 00:09:01,956
Since Akamaru smelled blood,
my guess is that there was

128
00:09:01,957 --> 00:09:04,490
a battle between Sasuke's
group and the two newcomers.

129
00:09:04,570 --> 00:09:06,296
If we go to the spot
where they fought, we

130
00:09:06,297 --> 00:09:09,051
might be able to gather
some useful information.

131
00:09:11,070 --> 00:09:13,010
Of course, we can't just rush in.

132
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:14,110
It might be a trap.

133
00:09:14,210 --> 00:09:17,850
So when we get closer, we'll go into full
reconnaissance mode and take it slowly.

134
00:09:18,110 --> 00:09:20,723
And while we're doing that,
Sasuke will have crossed beyond

135
00:09:20,724 --> 00:09:23,430
the borders of the Land
of Fire and out of our hands.

136
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:25,910
Okay, Shikamaru, so what's it gonna be?

137
00:09:28,190 --> 00:09:29,770
We follow Sasuke.

138
00:09:30,165 --> 00:09:30,950
Way to go!

139
00:09:31,170 --> 00:09:32,610
I knew you'd make the right choice!

140
00:09:33,450 --> 00:09:34,450
One thing.

141
00:09:35,490 --> 00:09:36,490
What?

142
00:09:36,810 --> 00:09:40,390
These guys have already been in one fight,
so they'll be on their guard.

143
00:09:40,710 --> 00:09:42,975
Unless they're complete
idiots, they'll have to

144
00:09:42,976 --> 00:09:45,290
know there's gonna be
more ninja on their trail.

145
00:09:47,410 --> 00:09:50,970
There's a good chance we'll hit some booby
traps or even an ambush up ahead.

146
00:09:53,610 --> 00:09:56,570
So from this point on, we proceed with
caution.

147
00:09:56,810 --> 00:10:01,350
I want everybody, not just Akamaru,
to put all your senses on full alert.

148
00:10:02,050 --> 00:10:05,550
If you catch a trace of anything
suspicious, sound the alarm.

149
00:10:05,930 --> 00:10:09,070
We want to find these guys before they
find us.

150
00:10:09,230 --> 00:10:09,550
Ha!

151
00:10:09,810 --> 00:10:10,450
Got it!

152
00:10:10,530 --> 00:10:14,550
And when we do find him, I'm gonna clobber
him with this brand new jutsu of mine!

153
00:10:14,950 --> 00:10:15,950
That Naruto.

154
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:19,690
Every time I turn around, he's got a new
trick up his sleeve.

155
00:10:20,030 --> 00:10:24,070
And just when I thought I'd finally caught
up to that little pain in the neck...

156
00:10:27,490 --> 00:10:30,030
The enemy's scent is here, all around us!

157
00:10:30,530 --> 00:10:31,530
Everyone stop!

158
00:10:34,839 --> 00:10:35,790
Look up on that tree.

159
00:10:35,791 --> 00:10:36,791
See that?

160
00:10:40,934 --> 00:10:41,934
A paper bomb.

161
00:10:42,539 --> 00:10:43,939
I'm sure there's five more of them.

162
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,080
A perimeter barrier.

163
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:47,440
That's what it is.

164
00:10:48,514 --> 00:10:49,514
A perimeter barrier?

165
00:10:50,474 --> 00:10:52,180
It's a type of trap ninjutsu.

166
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:57,020
There's a delay after the perimeter is
breached, giving the victim just enough

167
00:10:57,021 --> 00:10:59,720
time to get to the center of the area for
the full effect.

168
00:11:02,429 --> 00:11:03,520
It's a tricky jutsu.

169
00:11:03,824 --> 00:11:06,800
I learned about it in one of the books my
dad used to make me read.

170
00:11:10,939 --> 00:11:12,740
Now we gotta waste time going around it.

171
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,840
Great.

172
00:11:14,619 --> 00:11:17,900
Man, this whole forest is crawling with
booby traps.

173
00:11:18,489 --> 00:11:20,360
Yeah, but luckily they're easy to spot.

174
00:11:20,899 --> 00:11:23,020
These guys are moving fast and getting
sloppy.

175
00:11:25,309 --> 00:11:27,640
Naruto, do me a favor and watch where
you're going.

176
00:11:27,979 --> 00:11:29,379
I don't want you blowing us all up.

177
00:11:29,569 --> 00:11:30,729
There's tripwires everywhere.

178
00:11:30,900 --> 00:11:32,200
Tell me something I don't know!

179
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:35,039
Naruto, hold it!

180
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,200
Huh?

181
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:48,780
I don't know what you're talking about.

182
00:11:48,781 --> 00:11:49,940
Just in time.

183
00:11:50,830 --> 00:11:51,830
Got him.

184
00:11:52,404 --> 00:11:54,320
With my shadow possession jutsu.

185
00:11:55,319 --> 00:11:57,760
Didn't I tell you to watch your step,
you moron?

186
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:01,800
I get it.

187
00:12:02,599 --> 00:12:06,360
One wire catches the light and is easy to
see, the other is camouflaged.

188
00:12:06,959 --> 00:12:09,560
While you're busy avoiding the first,
you trip the second.

189
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:12,460
While you're busy avoiding the first,
you trip the second.

190
00:12:12,461 --> 00:12:13,861
We've created a trap within a trap.

191
00:12:15,269 --> 00:12:16,740
They're clever, whoever they are.

192
00:12:17,939 --> 00:12:21,020
All their other traps were quick and
dirty, as if they were moving fast.

193
00:12:22,139 --> 00:12:23,240
But not this one.

194
00:12:24,459 --> 00:12:25,700
They may have stopped to rest.

195
00:12:26,459 --> 00:12:27,720
Perhaps one of them is injured.

196
00:12:28,804 --> 00:12:30,040
Or is this part of the trap?

197
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:33,160
Yakuza!

198
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:43,460
I see them.

199
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,720
Well, let's go!

200
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:47,280
I'm dying to show these clowns what I've
got!

201
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,180
Is that right?

202
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:52,981
Hate to disappoint you, hotshot, but I've
got a new jutsu I've been working on too.

203
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,520
Yeah, me too.

204
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,700
Alright, calm down.

205
00:12:57,020 --> 00:12:59,400
First we make a plan and get everything
ready.

206
00:12:59,780 --> 00:13:02,420
Then, we nail these bastards.

207
00:13:11,209 --> 00:13:12,290
It drives me crazy.

208
00:13:12,985 --> 00:13:15,630
Stopping and having to rest when we should
be moving on.

209
00:13:17,039 --> 00:13:18,230
Buu, what did you expect?

210
00:13:19,169 --> 00:13:22,330
You think you can fight a level 2 battle
without feeling the effects?

211
00:13:23,229 --> 00:13:26,570
To feel like your whole body is completely
useless, it's frustrating.

212
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:30,790
Can't be helped if you're gonna take on
two Jonin-level ninja.

213
00:13:31,509 --> 00:13:34,070
If we'd held anything back, we'd have been
dead.

214
00:13:39,980 --> 00:13:40,980
That's it.

215
00:13:41,309 --> 00:13:45,000
Now Kiba, the timing of those smoke bombs
is absolutely crucial, got it?

216
00:13:45,580 --> 00:13:46,580
I got it.

217
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,440
So...

218
00:13:48,795 --> 00:13:49,400
Split up.

219
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:50,740
Let's go.

220
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:25,160
Looks like we've caught him napping.

221
00:14:26,180 --> 00:14:27,180
Hm?

222
00:14:27,605 --> 00:14:28,605
Hold on.

223
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:29,680
Where's Sasuke?

224
00:14:33,050 --> 00:14:34,050
He's in there.

225
00:14:34,375 --> 00:14:35,880
Inside that coffin.

226
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:38,360
You don't mean he's dead?

227
00:14:38,889 --> 00:14:40,820
It's been sealed with a barrier,
jutsu.

228
00:14:40,821 --> 00:14:42,501
That's hard for me to see through clearly.

229
00:14:43,754 --> 00:14:46,839
Considering they went through
all that trouble to get him,

230
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:49,560
I can't believe they'd be
willing to kill him so quickly.

231
00:14:52,794 --> 00:14:53,980
Let's just hope you're right.

232
00:15:22,140 --> 00:15:23,140
Well, well.

233
00:15:23,180 --> 00:15:28,261
I thought I was flushing a snake out of the
bushes, but all I got was a couple of mice.

234
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:31,560
Wait a minute.

235
00:15:31,709 --> 00:15:32,709
Calm down.

236
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:34,980
We're here to negotiate, not to fight.

237
00:15:35,625 --> 00:15:37,660
Can't we talk this over like reasonable
people?

238
00:15:38,420 --> 00:15:38,700
Heh.

239
00:15:39,339 --> 00:15:41,440
Let's not forget your friends,
shall we?

240
00:15:43,060 --> 00:15:44,060
Waaaaaah!

241
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:58,100
What good's that gonna do?

242
00:15:58,300 --> 00:16:00,120
Throw all the smoke bombs you want.

243
00:16:00,260 --> 00:16:01,600
I've still got you.

244
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:05,460
These threads are so fine, they're almost
invisible.

245
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,280
But they're stronger than they look.

246
00:16:07,281 --> 00:16:10,140
You may have already encountered them in
the forest.

247
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,360
Darn it!

248
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:21,360
So that double trap of tripwires you said,
in fact, was actually a triple trap.

249
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:23,460
Heh.

250
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,200
That was clever.

251
00:16:25,700 --> 00:16:28,500
So I guess that makes you the smart one of
the group.

252
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:32,080
You're about to be the dead one!

253
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,920
My body!

254
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:35,040
What's happening?

255
00:16:38,900 --> 00:16:40,340
Man, that was perfect!

256
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:44,530
Keepin' distractin' him, and you nailed
him with your shadow-possessin' jutsu!

257
00:16:45,460 --> 00:16:46,680
Yeah, that's right.

258
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:49,420
You're not the only ones who can spring a
trap.

259
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:51,740
Thanks for making me look good in front of
the squad.

260
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,080
Appreciate it.

261
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,320
Very impressive.

262
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:59,300
I'd be even more impressed if I hadn't
mastered that technique as well.

263
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:01,900
Huh?

264
00:17:02,140 --> 00:17:03,140
What was that?

265
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,420
Earth-style barrier.

266
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:08,859
Earth Dome Prison!

267
00:17:19,339 --> 00:17:21,619
Since I'm the one who caught him,
I get him.

268
00:17:22,159 --> 00:17:23,839
Anyone else have a problem with that?

269
00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:24,319
Heh.

270
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:25,599
Go ahead.

271
00:17:25,819 --> 00:17:27,000
But we're not waitin'.

272
00:17:27,299 --> 00:17:29,100
When you're done with them, catch up with
us.

273
00:17:36,129 --> 00:17:37,320
Don't take all day.

274
00:17:38,109 --> 00:17:39,460
Hey, you out there!

275
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:41,000
Let us out right now!

276
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:43,000
Yeah, like that's gonna help.

277
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:52,380
Cuddling bag!

278
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:12,320
The damn wall's rebuilding itself.

279
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:18,600
Hey, did you just-Yes, we saw it.

280
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:21,460
What is that?!

281
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:23,940
Yakugan!

282
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:34,120
The wall is... it's what?

283
00:18:34,220 --> 00:18:35,380
The wall is what?

284
00:18:37,060 --> 00:18:38,820
The wall is... it's what?

285
00:18:54,180 --> 00:18:55,180
Our chakra!

286
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:57,980
It's absorbing it, as if it were a sponge.

287
00:18:58,500 --> 00:18:59,500
Huh?

288
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:02,020
Great!

289
00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:06,040
It's not enough they bury
us alive in this oversized

290
00:19:06,041 --> 00:19:08,761
dung heap, now they're
trying to steal our chakra!

291
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:11,840
You gotta give these guys credit for
thoroughness, at least.

292
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:19,360
No way!

293
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:21,660
No way they can do this to us!

294
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:24,300
Whoever you are, let us out of here right
now!

295
00:19:50,659 --> 00:19:54,540
I feel like all my energy is draining out
of me.

296
00:20:02,804 --> 00:20:04,280
Something must be done, Shikamaru.

297
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,440
And quickly.

298
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:10,860
Man, I was an idiot to move in without
knowing the full extent of the enemy's powers.

299
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:13,240
Now we're trapped like rats.

300
00:20:13,241 --> 00:20:19,700
That's... that does it.

301
00:20:19,999 --> 00:20:20,999
Stand back, guys.

302
00:20:21,329 --> 00:20:23,880
I'm gonna bust out of here before my
chakra's all gone.

303
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:26,020
Akamaru!

304
00:20:27,060 --> 00:20:28,980
Have a food pill.

305
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:43,400
Okay.

306
00:20:43,401 --> 00:20:44,401
Ninja art.

307
00:20:44,580 --> 00:20:45,700
Human mimicry.

308
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:50,160
And as for me, ninja art beast mimicry.

309
00:21:03,940 --> 00:21:05,360
Fang over Fang!

310
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:13,460
Attaboy, Kiba!

311
00:21:13,540 --> 00:21:14,540
Go for it!

312
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:30,220
Go on.

313
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:31,840
Knock yourself out.

314
00:21:37,580 --> 00:21:48,620
Look at that.

315
00:21:48,820 --> 00:21:51,060
As soon as a crack appears, it repairs
itself.

316
00:21:53,060 --> 00:21:54,760
Same with the ground beneath it.

317
00:22:20,120 --> 00:22:25,681
I'd give us about ten more minutes of this...
before our chakra's completely drained.

318
00:22:42,420 --> 00:22:42,860
And we're back.

319
00:22:42,861 --> 00:22:43,240
No use.

320
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:46,540
I need all my energy to focus for the
Rasengan.

321
00:22:47,020 --> 00:22:48,260
There's no way in here.

322
00:22:48,600 --> 00:22:50,800
I've lost too much chakra as it is.

323
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,480
Hey, out there.

324
00:22:58,820 --> 00:23:00,100
Let me talk to your leader.

325
00:23:00,500 --> 00:23:01,920
I've got a deal to propose.

326
00:23:02,780 --> 00:23:05,440
What I'm thinking is that you let us out
of this thing.

327
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:08,000
And in return, we let you keep Sasuke.

328
00:23:08,001 --> 00:23:09,001
Huh?

329
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:11,740
But Chikamaru, what are you doing?

330
00:23:12,100 --> 00:23:13,520
My favorite part.

331
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:15,560
When they start pleading for their life.

332
00:23:17,020 --> 00:23:18,020
No deal.

333
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:20,060
I've never let a captive go before.

334
00:23:20,380 --> 00:23:22,040
I'm not about to start now.

335
00:23:22,460 --> 00:23:23,560
Aw, come on.

336
00:23:24,140 --> 00:23:28,080
Listen, how about you just let me go and
keep the others?

337
00:23:33,600 --> 00:23:34,940
All this fighting.

338
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,560
I'm tired of it.

339
00:23:36,700 --> 00:23:38,460
It's really not my thing.

340
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:42,260
You little... If you're selling us
out... I'm gonna wring your neck!

341
00:23:43,520 --> 00:23:44,680
Shut up, Kiba.

342
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:46,240
For once in your life.

343
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:47,900
What did you say?

344
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:52,040
So much for teamwork.

345
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,500
So you're really the leader, huh?

346
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:58,540
What a fine example you're setting for the
rest of your team.

347
00:24:00,300 --> 00:24:04,580
You see a man's true character when he's
pushed to the edge of death.

348
00:24:05,140 --> 00:24:07,220
But you're hardly a man at all.

349
00:24:07,580 --> 00:24:11,040
Certainly not one who's worthy of leading
a team of ninja into battle.

350
00:24:11,900 --> 00:24:12,900
Hmm.

351
00:24:14,520 --> 00:24:16,720
Sacrificing Sasuke and the rest of your
squad.

352
00:24:16,900 --> 00:24:17,160
Huh.

353
00:24:17,220 --> 00:24:19,360
So that's how a Leaf Chunin acts.

354
00:24:20,120 --> 00:24:22,580
Did you really believe I might let you
out?

355
00:24:22,760 --> 00:24:24,180
You deserve to die.

356
00:24:24,520 --> 00:24:26,880
That doesn't, Shikamaru, you dirty little
traitor!

357
00:24:27,020 --> 00:24:28,020
Let's take this outside!

358
00:24:28,440 --> 00:24:29,440
Just you and me!

359
00:24:29,580 --> 00:24:31,020
What do you mean, take this outside?

360
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,780
How are you gonna do that, you idiot?

361
00:24:32,860 --> 00:24:33,860
We're trapped in here.

362
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:34,960
What'd you call me?

363
00:24:35,020 --> 00:24:36,480
I called you an idiot, idiot!

364
00:24:36,780 --> 00:24:38,060
That's what I thought you said!

365
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:39,000
That's enough!

366
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:40,800
Everybody just shut up!

367
00:24:41,080 --> 00:24:42,080
Huh?

368
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:45,000
Choji?

369
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:03,262
Neji, I need you to focus
those eyes of yours on the

370
00:25:03,263 --> 00:25:05,880
wall directly behind you
and directly behind Choji.

371
00:25:06,020 --> 00:25:08,240
Do you think you have enough chakra left
for that?

372
00:25:08,760 --> 00:25:09,760
I think so.

373
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:10,680
Hold on!

374
00:25:10,820 --> 00:25:12,260
You're not gonna listen to him!

375
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:12,800
Naruto!

376
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:14,940
You still don't get it, do you?

377
00:25:15,060 --> 00:25:18,480
Don't you remember what Shikamaru said
when we came together as a team?

378
00:25:20,600 --> 00:25:24,500
I know I usually seem like a pretty lazy
guy, but not today.

379
00:25:25,760 --> 00:25:28,360
Because now I'm responsible for your
lives, too.

380
00:25:29,420 --> 00:25:30,420
Okay, Choji.

381
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:32,660
Try and keep your voice down, will ya?

382
00:25:32,940 --> 00:25:37,360
Kiba, are you up for trying to put another
dent in the wall behind Choji?

383
00:25:38,180 --> 00:25:38,920
Well, sure.

384
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,160
I guess.

385
00:25:41,780 --> 00:25:42,780
Hyaa!

386
00:25:43,720 --> 00:25:44,720
Holy fang!

387
00:25:48,460 --> 00:25:49,460
Huh.

388
00:25:51,060 --> 00:25:52,060
Bleh!

389
00:26:19,040 --> 00:26:19,060
Ugh.

390
00:26:19,080 --> 00:26:23,500
Their Okay.

391
00:26:23,501 --> 00:26:27,600
Now, Neji, mark the spot with your kunai
knife, will you?

392
00:26:28,359 --> 00:26:29,740
Choji, are you ready, buddy?

393
00:26:30,860 --> 00:26:32,640
Shikamaru, I was born ready.

394
00:26:32,900 --> 00:26:33,900
Good.

395
00:26:34,059 --> 00:26:35,140
Then let's get started.

396
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:37,000
Wait, let's get what started?

397
00:26:37,874 --> 00:26:43,521
As I said a moment ago, this wall
surrounding us has been infused with chakra.

398
00:26:43,745 --> 00:26:46,900
However, the strength of the chakra won't
be uniform.

399
00:26:46,901 --> 00:26:49,880
Some points in the wall must be weaker
than others.

400
00:26:50,340 --> 00:26:52,260
Shikamaru was able to figure that out.

401
00:26:52,935 --> 00:26:53,760
He did?

402
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:54,260
Really?

403
00:26:54,679 --> 00:26:55,680
You could have fooled me.

404
00:26:55,780 --> 00:26:56,780
When the heck was this?

405
00:26:57,249 --> 00:26:59,640
He's been watching, and taking it in.

406
00:27:00,300 --> 00:27:03,720
For example, when Kiba and Akamaru
attacked the wall.

407
00:27:04,100 --> 00:27:07,100
While you were watching them, he was
studying the wall.

408
00:27:07,300 --> 00:27:11,360
And he observed that some areas repaired
themselves more slowly than others.

409
00:27:13,700 --> 00:27:18,901
That led him to suspect that it was at those
points that the chakra was the weakest.

410
00:27:20,269 --> 00:27:22,320
Still, he needed to be sure.

411
00:27:22,860 --> 00:27:25,300
That's why he spoke to our captor as he
did.

412
00:27:25,780 --> 00:27:29,060
It was a ruse, to trick him into giving
away his position.

413
00:27:30,760 --> 00:27:34,840
And it worked, confirming that Shikamaru's
suspicions were right.

414
00:27:35,380 --> 00:27:37,684
The band of chakra
running through the wall was

415
00:27:37,685 --> 00:27:40,680
thinnest and weakest at the
point opposite his position.

416
00:27:42,320 --> 00:27:44,000
That's about right, isn't it?

417
00:27:45,225 --> 00:27:46,225
Hmph.

418
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:47,680
Heh.

419
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:50,840
And all the time, we thought he was
selling us out.

420
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,680
Gotta hand it to him.

421
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:55,980
He not only fooled the enemy, he had us
going, too.

422
00:27:56,509 --> 00:27:57,860
It's up to you, Choji.

423
00:27:58,260 --> 00:27:59,260
Okay!

424
00:28:01,300 --> 00:28:02,560
Expanse in Jutsu!

425
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:04,560
Alright!

426
00:28:05,020 --> 00:28:06,020
Here we go!

427
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:08,000
Baro!

428
00:28:09,780 --> 00:28:10,780
Baro!

429
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:12,720
Baro!

430
00:28:14,080 --> 00:28:15,120
Human Krogan!

431
00:28:17,020 --> 00:28:18,020
Aaaaaaaaaaah!

432
00:28:34,100 --> 00:28:36,100
Well, Choji.

433
00:29:01,420 --> 00:29:01,420
..

434
00:29:01,950 --> 00:29:05,600
There's no other way of
saying it... That was awesome!

435
00:29:06,420 --> 00:29:07,920
heh heh heh heh!

436
00:29:18,560 --> 00:29:21,260
Not a bad bit of handiwork, you guys.

437
00:29:23,439 --> 00:29:24,660
We're a bunch of losers.

438
00:29:25,180 --> 00:29:25,620
What?

439
00:29:26,169 --> 00:29:27,340
Who are you calling losers?

440
00:29:29,245 --> 00:29:31,440
Now that we're out, you're toast,
pal.

441
00:29:31,820 --> 00:29:32,620
Out of the way!

442
00:29:32,760 --> 00:29:33,820
This guy's mine!

443
00:29:34,370 --> 00:29:35,370
Wait, you two, stop!

444
00:29:37,400 --> 00:29:39,540
There's no way we can take him head on.

445
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:40,500
It's too dangerous.

446
00:29:40,501 --> 00:29:42,580
We just tore through this clown's barrier.

447
00:29:42,820 --> 00:29:43,820
How tough can he be?

448
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:52,180
Earth-style spear of gray!

449
00:29:52,940 --> 00:29:54,320
Are you insane?

450
00:30:10,580 --> 00:30:14,120
Haha, you're in charge of this ragtag
bunch, am I right?

451
00:30:14,780 --> 00:30:18,260
When you've got an idiot for a leader,
the whole team suffers.

452
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:20,120
Know what I mean?

453
00:30:21,680 --> 00:30:24,160
You don't want to follow a guy like this?

454
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:25,920
Let me get rid of him for you!

455
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:28,200
It's Batshit Chuchu!

456
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:30,020
Human form now!

457
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,000
Thanks, Choji.

458
00:30:34,559 --> 00:30:38,200
Oh, I try to help you guys out and look
what you do.

459
00:30:43,179 --> 00:30:47,020
I don't know which is more pathetic,
the fool or those who follow him.

460
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:50,361
Tell you what, you don't
want to keep working

461
00:30:50,362 --> 00:30:53,181
under this glum-faced
little shadow lover.

462
00:30:53,919 --> 00:30:56,840
I'll just kill you now and put you out of
your misery.

463
00:30:57,380 --> 00:31:01,540
It's time for you to shut your big mouth,
or I'll come shut it for you!

464
00:31:01,740 --> 00:31:02,740
Naruto!

465
00:31:03,784 --> 00:31:04,880
I'll handle him.

466
00:31:05,320 --> 00:31:06,980
This guy is mine.

467
00:31:07,320 --> 00:31:08,320
Hmm?

468
00:31:10,540 --> 00:31:11,020
Choji...

469
00:31:11,319 --> 00:31:12,800
What the heck are you talking about?

470
00:31:13,069 --> 00:31:15,400
This isn't the kind of guy you can take on
your own!

471
00:31:15,819 --> 00:31:16,980
He's mine, I said!

472
00:31:17,504 --> 00:31:20,860
Yeah, but... Choji, you're...

473
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:27,480
Shikamaru, take these food pills for
everyone.

474
00:31:29,760 --> 00:31:32,641
Choji, you're not
gonna... Uh-huh.

475
00:31:33,100 --> 00:31:35,520
Don't worry, I've got my secret weapon
with me.

476
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:38,080
Yeah, but Choji, this is...

477
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:42,160
Oh, this is priceless.

478
00:31:42,604 --> 00:31:44,140
You think I'm gonna wait forever?

479
00:31:44,740 --> 00:31:45,740
Enough!

480
00:31:46,080 --> 00:31:47,080
Enough of this!

481
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:48,860
I'm taking you all out right here!

482
00:31:50,120 --> 00:31:51,120
Get going!

483
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:52,240
Hurry!

484
00:31:55,520 --> 00:31:56,520
Pills?

485
00:31:56,560 --> 00:31:58,120
Those aren't food pills.

486
00:31:58,560 --> 00:31:59,760
So what are they?

487
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:02,160
First, the green spinach pill.

488
00:32:03,020 --> 00:32:05,020
Get out of my way, you joke!

489
00:32:10,380 --> 00:32:11,060
Impossible!

490
00:32:11,380 --> 00:32:12,940
He stopped me!

491
00:32:13,520 --> 00:32:14,200
Shikamaru!

492
00:32:14,420 --> 00:32:16,600
Take everybody and get out of here!

493
00:32:17,320 --> 00:32:21,500
Choji... What did the five
of us join together for?

494
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:26,880
If we lose Sasuke, we'll be just what this
guy says we are!

495
00:32:27,120 --> 00:32:31,260
A stupid idiot of a leader and his band of
rejects!

496
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:39,240
You'd better catch up with us,
Choji.

497
00:32:39,380 --> 00:32:40,220
You hear me?

498
00:32:40,221 --> 00:32:41,221
Yeah!

499
00:32:41,900 --> 00:32:42,980
Get out of here!

500
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:44,200
Go already!

501
00:32:44,380 --> 00:32:46,140
All right, let's move, you guys!

502
00:32:46,340 --> 00:32:47,340
Right!

503
00:32:54,080 --> 00:33:00,480
Choji... Once I finally finish you off
here, kid, your friends are gonna be next!

504
00:33:00,860 --> 00:33:03,660
That might not be as easy as you think it
is!

505
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:23,090
Wait, wait, wait!

506
00:33:25,270 --> 00:33:26,670
I'll make you pay for this!

507
00:33:31,890 --> 00:33:40,531
I will... I will...
I'll stop you.

508
00:33:54,970 --> 00:33:56,850
A parting gift from Choji.

509
00:33:57,170 --> 00:33:57,970
Eat up.

510
00:33:58,070 --> 00:33:59,070
Got it.

511
00:33:59,350 --> 00:34:00,870
We owe you one, Choji.

512
00:34:03,430 --> 00:34:04,430
Kiba!

513
00:34:05,390 --> 00:34:06,390
Thanks, Naruto.

514
00:34:07,690 --> 00:34:10,989
Shikamaru, that certain pill we saw Choji
take back there...

515
00:34:10,990 --> 00:34:13,570
It seemed like some sort of last-minute
trump card.

516
00:34:13,571 --> 00:34:15,710
Do you really think he can win?

517
00:34:16,310 --> 00:34:19,270
Yeah, I mean, he said he had some sort of
secret weapon on him.

518
00:34:19,750 --> 00:34:21,969
Don't worry, Choji's got a plan up his
sleeve.

519
00:34:22,130 --> 00:34:25,790
He brought along with him the Aki Michi
clan's secret triple threat.

520
00:34:27,150 --> 00:34:29,570
Pills that grant a person explosive power.

521
00:34:29,810 --> 00:34:31,070
There are three of them.

522
00:34:31,290 --> 00:34:33,310
Green, yellow, and red.

523
00:34:34,469 --> 00:34:38,830
The amount of energy that each of those
pills contains is absolutely massive.

524
00:34:39,790 --> 00:34:40,909
Oh, I gotcha!

525
00:34:41,150 --> 00:34:43,409
So that's why he was acting so confident!

526
00:34:43,570 --> 00:34:48,710
Yeah, but any pill that works that well
always comes with side effects.

527
00:34:52,610 --> 00:34:59,220
I didn't think the spinach pill by itself
would hurt so much!

528
00:35:02,134 --> 00:35:05,220
I hope he can settle things with the green
pill alone.

529
00:35:06,020 --> 00:35:08,000
Just don't take the red one, Choji.

530
00:35:08,560 --> 00:35:09,620
Whatever you do.

531
00:35:11,920 --> 00:35:14,880
I'm gonna finish this all in one blow!

532
00:35:15,900 --> 00:35:16,900
Hmm?

533
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:19,840
Hmm.

534
00:35:27,310 --> 00:35:30,170
Expansion... CHO-CHO!

535
00:35:36,870 --> 00:35:39,370
SPIKY HUMAN BOWLER!

536
00:35:39,371 --> 00:35:40,630
AAAAAAAAH!

537
00:35:49,260 --> 00:35:53,910
He's upped his rotation and destructive
power by using those kunai-like spikes.

538
00:35:56,670 --> 00:35:57,670
AAAAAAAAH!

539
00:35:59,350 --> 00:36:01,610
Earth-style Terra Shield!

540
00:36:02,130 --> 00:36:03,130
AAAAAAAAH!

541
00:36:06,030 --> 00:36:07,030
AAAAAAAAH!

542
00:36:07,590 --> 00:36:08,590
AAAAAAAAH!

543
00:36:08,930 --> 00:36:09,350
AAAAAAAAH!

544
00:36:09,351 --> 00:36:11,410
What a shiii...

545
00:36:13,330 --> 00:36:14,330
AAAAAAAAAAH!

546
00:36:15,300 --> 00:36:16,300
AAAAAAAAH!

547
00:36:18,230 --> 00:36:19,230
AAAAAAAAH!

548
00:36:23,950 --> 00:36:24,950
AAAAAAAAH!

549
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:33,490
Don't get carried away, you little fool!

550
00:36:34,410 --> 00:36:34,650
WHOO!

551
00:36:35,430 --> 00:36:37,411
CHATTER... CHATTER... POW!

552
00:36:38,270 --> 00:36:39,270
AAAAAAAAH!

553
00:36:44,170 --> 00:36:44,660
Huh?

554
00:36:45,060 --> 00:36:46,060
Huh?

555
00:36:46,780 --> 00:36:47,780
Huh!

556
00:36:48,350 --> 00:36:49,360
No one ever told you?

557
00:36:49,950 --> 00:36:53,580
In every team of five, there's always
somebody in the mix who's just dead weight.

558
00:36:53,790 --> 00:36:56,540
The guy who's always the butt of
everyone's jokes.

559
00:36:57,095 --> 00:37:02,520
And when thick comes to thin, he gets cast
aside like the worthless pawn he is.

560
00:37:05,160 --> 00:37:06,820
That's who you are.

561
00:37:10,580 --> 00:37:11,800
Look, Choji.

562
00:37:11,980 --> 00:37:13,960
You've got to stop thinking about food.

563
00:37:13,961 --> 00:37:16,320
Do some training for once.

564
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:20,740
Ridiculous stunts like this are why
everyone always makes fun of you.

565
00:37:21,080 --> 00:37:22,340
You're such a fat.

566
00:37:22,700 --> 00:37:24,220
But for this kind of
thing, don't you think

567
00:37:24,221 --> 00:37:26,841
your first choice should
be someone like Shino?

568
00:37:37,860 --> 00:37:43,280
No matter how hard I try on my own,
I...

569
00:37:53,060 --> 00:37:55,900
No matter how hard I try on my own,
I... Looks like I hit it right on the nose.

570
00:37:57,400 --> 00:38:01,000
It looks as though the Leaf Village is
running short on ninja.

571
00:38:01,360 --> 00:38:04,860
If they're sending out bunglers like you
to be part of a search team.

572
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:10,000
But...

573
00:38:24,900 --> 00:38:26,440
Maybe they're just making fun of me.

574
00:38:26,441 --> 00:38:30,640
Just a little of my time for the
not-so-good-for-me.

575
00:38:31,080 --> 00:38:31,540
In this age, I'll let you do what you want
with even a little help.

576
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:33,000
Alright, let's go.

577
00:38:34,280 --> 00:38:35,280
Let's go!

578
00:38:38,200 --> 00:38:42,520
Well, I'm sorry, Shino.

579
00:38:43,360 --> 00:38:43,580
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

580
00:38:43,700 --> 00:38:45,220
We'll take care of it some other time.

581
00:38:48,340 --> 00:38:51,120
But I'm probably not as good a fighter as
you are.

582
00:38:51,560 --> 00:38:52,560
I mean, really.

583
00:38:52,680 --> 00:38:56,660
If I had been facing off against you,
I probably would have given up the fight.

584
00:38:57,500 --> 00:38:59,440
And you should just keep being you.

585
00:39:03,380 --> 00:39:10,840
But... Shikamaru, he's always... Huh?

586
00:39:12,280 --> 00:39:16,340
Shikamaru, he's always believed in me.

587
00:39:16,600 --> 00:39:18,700
Choji, are you ready, buddy?

588
00:39:23,080 --> 00:39:27,000
He believes I really am strong.

589
00:39:34,980 --> 00:39:38,540
That's why you trusted me to handle this
myself!

590
00:39:42,800 --> 00:39:44,580
Pretty aggressive, Chuck.

591
00:39:46,260 --> 00:39:47,260
Not bad.

592
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:49,860
But a far cry from being a main dish.

593
00:39:53,200 --> 00:39:55,000
Here I come, Fatso!

594
00:39:56,320 --> 00:39:58,240
Don't you call me that!

595
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:00,000
I'm not a fatso!

596
00:40:01,040 --> 00:40:02,040
You're a fatso!

597
00:40:02,580 --> 00:40:10,360
I'm a fatso!

598
00:40:10,740 --> 00:40:11,740
I'm a fatso!

599
00:40:12,080 --> 00:40:13,380
I'm a fatso!

600
00:40:13,381 --> 00:40:15,140
I'm a fatso!

601
00:40:15,860 --> 00:40:16,560
I'm a fatso!

602
00:40:16,660 --> 00:40:17,660
I'm a fatso!

603
00:40:17,880 --> 00:40:18,720
I'm a fatso!

604
00:40:18,721 --> 00:40:25,240
I'm a fatso!

605
00:40:33,040 --> 00:40:35,420
Don't mess with me, scum!

606
00:40:39,280 --> 00:40:42,820
Oh, this... What the...
Super Inferno Jutsu!

607
00:40:58,460 --> 00:41:00,660
Shikamaru, I did it!

608
00:41:02,660 --> 00:41:03,660
What?

609
00:41:07,820 --> 00:41:13,260
I don't believe I have to go to the second
state for an opponent as weak as this one.

610
00:41:18,040 --> 00:41:19,120
Slamming Pulse!

611
00:41:34,520 --> 00:41:36,500
Super Inferno Jutsu!

612
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:41,740
What the... He changed his form!

613
00:41:42,340 --> 00:41:44,700
I'm afraid it's all over for you.

614
00:41:45,080 --> 00:41:47,220
In second state, I'm invincible.

615
00:41:47,500 --> 00:41:50,440
I can dish out ten times as much power as
I could before.

616
00:42:00,180 --> 00:42:01,960
It hurts to move.

617
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:05,960
I didn't know the side effects of a curry
pill would be so intense.

618
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:12,540
You better listen to me, because I'm about
to teach you an important lesson.

619
00:42:13,020 --> 00:42:16,160
This is what happens to weaklings!

620
00:42:20,220 --> 00:42:21,260
You're pathetic.

621
00:42:21,900 --> 00:42:24,780
You'd be better off playing ninja with
your friends.

622
00:42:31,740 --> 00:42:32,760
It's for Choji.

623
00:42:33,410 --> 00:42:34,900
He promised us he'd catch up.

624
00:42:35,799 --> 00:42:38,880
Trust me, he will beat that guy.

625
00:42:39,860 --> 00:42:41,780
And after he does, he'll come and find us.

626
00:42:43,940 --> 00:42:45,600
No doubt about it.

627
00:42:46,005 --> 00:42:47,740
If anyone can defeat him, it's Choji.

628
00:42:50,340 --> 00:42:52,060
Well, as long as we've stopped.

629
00:42:53,660 --> 00:42:54,660
Good idea.

630
00:42:58,940 --> 00:42:59,960
All right, everyone.

631
00:43:00,180 --> 00:43:00,740
Let's go.

632
00:43:00,760 --> 00:43:03,280
Let's get Sasuke back before Choji catches
up.

633
00:43:03,840 --> 00:43:04,360
Huh?

634
00:43:04,620 --> 00:43:05,800
Hey, wait for me!

635
00:43:06,474 --> 00:43:07,520
All right!

636
00:43:07,900 --> 00:43:08,900
Here we come!

637
00:43:13,200 --> 00:43:13,980
Jirobo's late.

638
00:43:14,140 --> 00:43:15,500
He should have gotten here by now.

639
00:43:15,860 --> 00:43:18,360
Well, you know how enormous his appetite
can be.

640
00:43:18,720 --> 00:43:21,400
He's probably squeezing out every last bit
of chakra.

641
00:43:21,900 --> 00:43:24,600
Man, I wish I could be in his shoes right
now.

642
00:43:32,170 --> 00:43:33,170
Huh?

643
00:43:40,390 --> 00:43:44,190
Now that I'm in my second state,
I'm gonna need a lot more chakra.

644
00:43:44,870 --> 00:43:48,450
Which means I'm going to have to take
whatever you have left inside you!

645
00:43:49,570 --> 00:43:50,850
All right, kiddo.

646
00:43:51,410 --> 00:43:53,050
Let's get this over with!

647
00:43:58,130 --> 00:43:58,670
Huh?

648
00:43:58,671 --> 00:44:00,790
You don't have very much left,
do ya?

649
00:44:01,330 --> 00:44:02,250
Empty already?

650
00:44:02,251 --> 00:44:02,490
Are you ready?

651
00:44:02,970 --> 00:44:04,530
You weakling!

652
00:44:04,650 --> 00:44:05,890
I'm still hungry!

653
00:44:21,910 --> 00:44:25,150
I said, I'm still hungry!

654
00:44:27,090 --> 00:44:29,090
Oh, of course.

655
00:44:29,230 --> 00:44:30,910
Fatso only left one chip.

656
00:44:32,490 --> 00:44:35,050
Well, I guess I'll take what I can get.

657
00:44:39,350 --> 00:44:41,590
How does it feel to be a pawn?

658
00:44:41,750 --> 00:44:44,630
To be sacrificed by your so-called
friends?

659
00:44:45,070 --> 00:44:46,310
Left here for dead.

660
00:44:46,570 --> 00:44:48,390
A pitiful Fatso.

661
00:44:48,670 --> 00:44:50,370
The odd man out.

662
00:44:50,890 --> 00:44:52,950
You can't play ninja with us anymore!

663
00:44:54,870 --> 00:44:55,910
But why can't I?

664
00:44:56,900 --> 00:44:58,580
Because whenever you play with us,
we lose.

665
00:44:59,270 --> 00:45:00,650
Yeah, you're way too slow.

666
00:45:03,890 --> 00:45:07,190
You know, guys, without him, the teams
aren't gonna be even.

667
00:45:07,590 --> 00:45:10,950
It'd be lame, like if he played a game of
shogi with one piece missing.

668
00:45:11,550 --> 00:45:12,550
Huh?

669
00:45:13,575 --> 00:45:16,730
But if you have one piece that's totally
useless, it's the same thing.

670
00:45:17,210 --> 00:45:18,390
Yeah, what he said.

671
00:45:21,870 --> 00:45:25,190
It's our team, and we don't mind having
one less person, so let's just play.

672
00:45:25,650 --> 00:45:28,290
Well, if it's okay with you, I guess it's
fine.

673
00:45:28,790 --> 00:45:29,950
Okay then, it's settled!

674
00:45:30,230 --> 00:45:32,010
We're so gonna win this time!

675
00:45:32,011 --> 00:45:32,350
Yeah!

676
00:45:32,830 --> 00:45:33,550
Where should we hide?

677
00:45:33,570 --> 00:45:34,250
What do you think?

678
00:45:34,370 --> 00:45:35,850
At least Chunky's not playing.

679
00:45:37,250 --> 00:45:37,970
Here's the plan.

680
00:45:38,070 --> 00:45:41,230
You guys go left, I'll take the right and
hide in the alley.

681
00:46:11,070 --> 00:46:15,130
And they said the whole Akimichi clan is
fat and slow.

682
00:46:15,710 --> 00:46:17,450
Then everybody laughed at me.

683
00:46:18,050 --> 00:46:19,050
Did they really?

684
00:46:23,260 --> 00:46:24,960
Let me tell you something, son.

685
00:46:25,690 --> 00:46:28,940
None of those boys have as kind a heart as
you do.

686
00:46:28,941 --> 00:46:29,941
Hmm?

687
00:46:30,930 --> 00:46:33,913
And someday you'll have
a group of real friends who

688
00:46:33,914 --> 00:46:36,600
see that quality inside
you and respect you for it.

689
00:46:38,485 --> 00:46:42,660
You'll find friends who believe in you,
who trust you with their lives.

690
00:46:43,660 --> 00:46:45,060
Cherish those friends, Choji.

691
00:46:45,520 --> 00:46:46,520
I...

692
00:46:48,520 --> 00:46:49,520
Huh?

693
00:46:49,599 --> 00:46:50,599
Oh, it's you!

694
00:46:50,760 --> 00:46:51,000
Hmm?

695
00:46:51,560 --> 00:46:52,560
Oh, yeah.

696
00:46:52,880 --> 00:46:54,160
You were with those kids.

697
00:46:55,060 --> 00:46:56,580
Weren't you playing ninja with them?

698
00:46:56,800 --> 00:46:56,940
Heh.

699
00:46:56,941 --> 00:46:58,940
They were a drag, so I quit.

700
00:46:59,380 --> 00:46:59,820
Really?

701
00:47:00,330 --> 00:47:02,680
By the way, you're kinda sitting on my
special spot.

702
00:47:03,075 --> 00:47:04,240
Your special spot?

703
00:47:04,640 --> 00:47:05,020
Yeah.

704
00:47:05,180 --> 00:47:07,503
On a nice day like this,
I always come out here

705
00:47:07,504 --> 00:47:09,680
and lie on my back and
just stare at the clouds.

706
00:47:09,900 --> 00:47:10,900
You know?

707
00:47:12,115 --> 00:47:13,480
You came to look at clouds?

708
00:47:15,060 --> 00:47:16,060
That's right.

709
00:47:16,380 --> 00:47:17,380
So can I sit?

710
00:47:18,074 --> 00:47:19,080
Oh, sure.

711
00:47:22,980 --> 00:47:25,080
This is such an awesome spot.

712
00:47:25,081 --> 00:47:26,740
The sky looks amazing.

713
00:47:29,380 --> 00:47:30,380
You're right.

714
00:47:34,410 --> 00:47:35,410
Hey.

715
00:47:35,870 --> 00:47:36,870
What?

716
00:47:38,445 --> 00:47:40,190
The clouds are pretty cool from down here.

717
00:47:40,820 --> 00:47:42,250
Wanna lie back and watch with me?

718
00:47:43,290 --> 00:47:44,490
Uh, yeah.

719
00:47:44,630 --> 00:47:45,630
Thanks.

720
00:47:46,360 --> 00:47:48,950
Hey, you know, I brought some snacks with
me.

721
00:47:49,510 --> 00:47:50,330
You wanna share them?

722
00:47:50,490 --> 00:47:51,490
That'd be great!

723
00:47:53,830 --> 00:47:55,030
Hey, thanks.

724
00:47:59,270 --> 00:48:01,410
Eating chips and watching clouds.

725
00:48:01,670 --> 00:48:03,230
Man, this is the best.

726
00:48:03,590 --> 00:48:04,590
Yep.

727
00:48:08,450 --> 00:48:10,570
By the way, my name's Shikamaru.

728
00:48:10,730 --> 00:48:11,850
I'm from the Nara clan.

729
00:48:12,170 --> 00:48:13,190
What about you?

730
00:48:13,410 --> 00:48:14,410
What's your name?

731
00:48:14,710 --> 00:48:15,750
It's Choji.

732
00:48:16,110 --> 00:48:18,910
My name is Choji, and I'm from the
Akimichi clan.

733
00:48:19,530 --> 00:48:20,530
Choji, huh?

734
00:48:20,950 --> 00:48:23,330
I got a feeling that you and me'll be
friends.

735
00:48:24,165 --> 00:48:25,165
Yeah, me too.

736
00:48:26,850 --> 00:48:27,850
Hmph.

737
00:48:43,610 --> 00:48:45,290
Shikamaru, I'm sorry.

738
00:48:45,850 --> 00:48:47,550
I'm not gonna catch up.

739
00:48:48,010 --> 00:48:49,010
It's over.

740
00:48:49,525 --> 00:48:50,650
Say your prayers.

741
00:48:51,190 --> 00:48:52,190
No.

742
00:48:52,230 --> 00:48:54,430
I have to stop him.

743
00:48:54,750 --> 00:48:57,710
Even if it means I die, I've got to win.

744
00:48:58,070 --> 00:49:00,150
There's nothing you can do to stop me!

745
00:49:01,810 --> 00:49:09,810
P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-

746
00:49:09,860 --> 00:49:10,860
Mm-hmm.

747
00:49:28,620 --> 00:49:29,800
Sounds good.

748
00:49:30,740 --> 00:49:31,620
Awesome.

749
00:49:31,621 --> 00:49:37,040
Your mom probably thinks a lot of me like
that, doesn't it, Thot?

750
00:49:37,200 --> 00:49:38,500
You think so, don't you?

751
00:49:39,160 --> 00:49:39,800
Yeah!

752
00:49:39,801 --> 00:49:41,460
Set, go!

753
00:49:41,461 --> 00:49:41,520
Go!

754
00:49:41,521 --> 00:49:42,260
C'mon!

755
00:49:42,261 --> 00:49:42,580
Shikamaru, are you okay?

756
00:49:42,581 --> 00:49:42,980
I'm okay.

757
00:49:42,981 --> 00:49:44,461
A hundred times stronger than before.

758
00:49:51,260 --> 00:49:54,700
People hold grudges when you take
something important from them.

759
00:49:54,840 --> 00:49:56,460
Like, for instance, their food.

760
00:49:56,840 --> 00:50:00,640
That strike I gave you was for eating the
last bite of my favorite snack.

761
00:50:01,800 --> 00:50:02,320
Impossible.

762
00:50:02,800 --> 00:50:05,980
This bug has so much chakra, his body's
actually changed.

763
00:50:06,480 --> 00:50:08,280
And this next attack...

764
00:50:09,920 --> 00:50:14,520
is for calling me names like Pawn,
Fatso, and Loser!

765
00:50:15,320 --> 00:50:18,900
I can handle being picked on, but what
you've done is unforgivable!

766
00:50:19,500 --> 00:50:22,960
He was my best friend, and you insulted
him!

767
00:50:23,220 --> 00:50:24,420
How dare you!

768
00:50:24,680 --> 00:50:29,460
You can steal my very last bite of my very
best food, you can mock me all you want,

769
00:50:29,640 --> 00:50:32,600
but when you insult my best friend...

770
00:50:33,760 --> 00:50:35,580
I will obliterate you!

771
00:50:38,280 --> 00:50:41,460
All of my chakra... to my left hand!

772
00:50:43,000 --> 00:50:47,200
This last attack... is worth my whole
life!

773
00:50:48,220 --> 00:50:49,320
Please, no!

774
00:50:49,560 --> 00:50:50,820
Please don't do it!

775
00:51:33,750 --> 00:51:34,750
I did it!

776
00:51:35,510 --> 00:51:37,970
A guy like me... I beat him!

777
00:52:03,530 --> 00:52:04,820
My friends...

778
00:53:30,980 --> 00:53:31,980
Oh...

779
00:54:01,350 --> 00:54:02,350
What's the matter?

780
00:54:09,440 --> 00:54:10,680
We're getting close!

781
00:54:22,630 --> 00:54:23,630
That's strange.

782
00:54:24,030 --> 00:54:27,810
It's been quite a long time and we still
haven't encountered a single trap.

783
00:54:28,330 --> 00:54:30,710
Well Shikamaru, what's your assessment?

784
00:54:32,590 --> 00:54:35,270
It looks to me like we've been
underestimated.

785
00:54:35,910 --> 00:54:37,010
They're cocky.

786
00:54:37,225 --> 00:54:41,591
They think we're all dead now, and their
big guy's the only one following them.

787
00:54:41,770 --> 00:54:44,370
They don't need to set a trap for their
own man, do they?

788
00:54:44,710 --> 00:54:45,710
Those idiots!

789
00:54:46,070 --> 00:54:47,630
They think we're so weak!

790
00:54:48,030 --> 00:54:50,530
It seems you're right about our enemies,
Shikamaru.

791
00:54:51,260 --> 00:54:54,190
And it's insulting to be underestimated
like this.

792
00:54:55,290 --> 00:54:57,890
But still, this could be our chance.

793
00:54:57,891 --> 00:54:59,950
I hear ya.

794
00:55:00,770 --> 00:55:02,610
Now we can take him by surprise.

795
00:55:09,110 --> 00:55:10,750
Jirobo's pretty late, isn't he?

796
00:55:11,410 --> 00:55:13,410
He was, but he just arrived.

797
00:55:19,610 --> 00:55:20,910
Well, it's about time.

798
00:55:21,050 --> 00:55:21,930
You were gone a while.

799
00:55:22,010 --> 00:55:23,010
What took so long?

800
00:55:25,370 --> 00:55:25,810
Sorry.

801
00:55:25,811 --> 00:55:28,690
It took longer than I thought to eat all
that loser's chakra.

802
00:55:31,410 --> 00:55:32,410
Listen, fatso.

803
00:55:32,730 --> 00:55:34,790
Don't slow us down so you can eat more.

804
00:55:35,250 --> 00:55:36,390
You see that coffin?

805
00:55:36,850 --> 00:55:39,050
You're the one who's supposed to be
carrying it.

806
00:55:39,170 --> 00:55:41,270
So do your job, you slob.

807
00:55:42,330 --> 00:55:43,330
Okay.

808
00:55:48,220 --> 00:55:49,660
Well, well, Jirobo.

809
00:55:50,080 --> 00:55:52,000
Aren't you awfully easygoing today?

810
00:55:53,540 --> 00:55:54,540
Yes, so what?

811
00:55:55,900 --> 00:55:59,740
Well, it's just that I'm not going to be
handing over this coffin to you.

812
00:56:00,090 --> 00:56:01,680
Because you're not the real Jirobo!

813
00:56:10,240 --> 00:56:10,880
You're just gonna have to calm down for a
better chance.

814
00:56:10,881 --> 00:56:12,520
Let me take down this one, fellas!

815
00:56:13,020 --> 00:56:13,660
Sackon!

816
00:56:13,680 --> 00:56:14,120
Tayuya!

817
00:56:14,420 --> 00:56:15,400
Go on!

818
00:56:15,401 --> 00:56:16,401
I'll catch ya!

819
00:56:21,280 --> 00:56:26,520
The real Jirobo is always scolding Tayuya
about her rather coarse language.

820
00:56:26,980 --> 00:56:29,120
I'm not a good kid to quiet down after
all.

821
00:56:30,260 --> 00:56:32,320
Hmm... You got me.

822
00:56:33,600 --> 00:56:34,680
Ninja Art!

823
00:56:34,800 --> 00:56:35,800
Spider Web Net!

824
00:56:39,660 --> 00:56:40,660
Surprise!

825
00:56:44,080 --> 00:56:45,080
Did you see me?

826
00:56:51,100 --> 00:56:52,300
Ninja Art!

827
00:56:52,480 --> 00:56:53,520
Spiral Spider Web!

828
00:56:58,180 --> 00:56:59,360
Fang Over Fang!

829
00:57:02,000 --> 00:57:03,000
Spiral Spider Web!

830
00:57:05,980 --> 00:57:07,800
I won't let you get away!

831
00:57:09,240 --> 00:57:11,280
You stole my line, punk.

832
00:57:12,640 --> 00:57:14,360
You should look down at your feet.

833
00:57:17,160 --> 00:57:18,280
You coward!

834
00:57:19,640 --> 00:57:21,980
Do you really think you can stop us that
easily?

835
00:57:22,700 --> 00:57:24,360
Why don't you shut up?

836
00:57:29,320 --> 00:57:30,320
My turn.

837
00:57:30,900 --> 00:57:31,900
Huh?

838
00:57:39,640 --> 00:57:40,640
Nachi, no!

839
00:57:40,880 --> 00:57:41,880
He's stuck!

840
00:57:41,920 --> 00:57:42,620
Darn it.

841
00:57:42,720 --> 00:57:45,580
He got me, Naruto, Kiba, and Nachi.

842
00:57:45,600 --> 00:57:47,840
We followed the plan, but it's not
working.

843
00:57:48,360 --> 00:57:49,360
Huh?

844
00:57:53,860 --> 00:57:54,860
Aww...

845
00:58:03,600 --> 00:58:04,120
I can't believe it.

846
00:58:04,121 --> 00:58:06,780
How'd you like to see the inside of an
airtight cocoon?

847
00:58:12,620 --> 00:58:13,620
No!

848
00:58:18,660 --> 00:58:19,280
Come on!

849
00:58:19,340 --> 00:58:20,140
Come on!

850
00:58:20,360 --> 00:58:22,220
What the heck's this thread made out of?

851
00:58:22,380 --> 00:58:23,620
I can't cut it!

852
00:58:24,660 --> 00:58:25,660
It's useless.

853
00:58:25,980 --> 00:58:29,260
My spider silk is so powerful,
nothing can break it.

854
00:58:29,261 --> 00:58:31,280
Two elephants couldn't pull it apart.

855
00:58:34,820 --> 00:58:37,480
Heh, that one's able to use Shadow Clone.

856
00:58:49,960 --> 00:58:53,700
No matter what I do, this thread keeps
sticking to me.

857
00:58:53,701 --> 00:58:53,840
Finally.

858
00:58:53,980 --> 00:58:58,080
This stickiness must come from combining
his chakra with some sort of fluid.

859
00:58:59,300 --> 00:59:01,060
And the strength is unreal.

860
00:59:01,540 --> 00:59:04,100
Even after he releases
the thread, his chakra

861
00:59:04,120 --> 00:59:06,760
is still flowing through
it, giving it power.

862
00:59:07,820 --> 00:59:08,820
Impossible!

863
00:59:09,020 --> 00:59:11,780
The level of this jutsu is out of this
world!

864
00:59:12,060 --> 00:59:13,420
It's unstoppable!

865
00:59:15,820 --> 00:59:16,820
No, wait.

866
00:59:17,080 --> 00:59:18,480
I've got to calm down.

867
00:59:20,920 --> 00:59:22,340
Focus my chakra.

868
00:59:38,040 --> 00:59:38,600
I've got to calm down.

869
00:59:38,601 --> 00:59:39,140
Ninja Art!

870
00:59:39,320 --> 00:59:40,700
Sticky Spider Thread!

871
00:59:41,520 --> 00:59:44,040
That's a different color from the thread
he used before.

872
00:59:45,170 --> 00:59:46,170
What's he gonna do?

873
00:59:57,020 --> 00:59:58,020
I see.

874
00:59:58,220 --> 00:59:59,520
It's solidifying.

875
01:00:01,420 --> 01:00:04,880
Since you'll be my first victim,
let's make this entertaining.

876
01:00:05,640 --> 01:00:09,600
I'm going to play a little game to find
out which one of you is the real one.

877
01:00:10,060 --> 01:00:11,140
What did you just say?

878
01:00:12,944 --> 01:00:15,880
Contestant one, let's try you at the end.

879
01:00:22,080 --> 01:00:23,960
Whichever you are, you're pretty lucky.

880
01:00:23,961 --> 01:00:26,620
Next, let's try two at a time.

881
01:00:26,720 --> 01:00:28,780
The odds will be doubled in my favor.

882
01:00:39,780 --> 01:00:42,480
You are a very lucky guy, you know that?

883
01:00:42,680 --> 01:00:45,020
But this time, I got a 50-50 shot.

884
01:00:45,300 --> 01:00:46,060
Here it comes!

885
01:00:46,061 --> 01:00:47,061
Here it comes!

886
01:00:53,440 --> 01:00:56,440
Well, somehow we made it all the way to
the bitter end.

887
01:00:56,800 --> 01:00:59,820
Well, weakling, it was fun playing with
you.

888
01:00:59,940 --> 01:01:02,820
But unfortunately, the game's over for you
now.

889
01:01:07,800 --> 01:01:08,800
Now die!

890
01:01:10,820 --> 01:01:12,500
One down and three to go.

891
01:01:14,420 --> 01:01:15,620
Wait, where did he...

892
01:01:26,340 --> 01:01:30,287
Of course, he let his shadow
clones get caught while the

893
01:01:30,288 --> 01:01:33,520
real one hid and waited for a
chance to catch me off guard.

894
01:01:34,600 --> 01:01:38,680
For a wimp like that to come up with such
a deception in the heat of battle.

895
01:01:39,100 --> 01:01:40,920
He's not so dumb after all.

896
01:01:42,660 --> 01:01:43,660
However...

897
01:01:48,160 --> 01:01:50,640
It looks like you're at the end of your
rope.

898
01:01:53,900 --> 01:01:55,060
How did he...

899
01:01:55,680 --> 01:01:56,680
Naruto!

900
01:01:57,260 --> 01:01:58,880
Thanks for stalling him for me.

901
01:01:59,100 --> 01:02:00,100
Magi!

902
01:02:01,660 --> 01:02:02,960
I trapped you.

903
01:02:03,620 --> 01:02:04,980
How did you get free?

904
01:02:05,880 --> 01:02:06,420
Ah!

905
01:02:06,620 --> 01:02:07,620
Ah!

906
01:02:08,480 --> 01:02:10,860
Your spider web had a chakra base.

907
01:02:11,800 --> 01:02:16,140
And chakra-built substances don't stand a
chance against my gentle fist attack.

908
01:02:18,140 --> 01:02:19,900
This guy's jutsu.

909
01:02:22,060 --> 01:02:24,820
I think I'm the only one who can handle
it.

910
01:02:27,180 --> 01:02:28,600
Go on, you guys.

911
01:02:29,260 --> 01:02:30,760
I'll take care of him.

912
01:02:34,100 --> 01:02:36,391
We all embarked on
this mission to find

913
01:02:36,392 --> 01:02:38,700
Sasuke and bring him
back home to the village.

914
01:02:39,420 --> 01:02:41,880
But that's not the only reason that we've
come.

915
01:02:42,300 --> 01:02:45,580
We are on this mission to protect a fellow
shinobi.

916
01:02:45,820 --> 01:02:48,400
To defend the bond of the Hidden Leaf
Village.

917
01:02:54,760 --> 01:02:55,320
Listen.

918
01:02:55,321 --> 01:02:58,560
Sasuke's out there right now, heading
toward Orochimaru.

919
01:02:58,561 --> 01:03:02,300
We can't allow such evil to take someone
from our village.

920
01:03:03,340 --> 01:03:04,800
That is not our way.

921
01:03:06,760 --> 01:03:07,960
What's more...

922
01:03:22,630 --> 01:03:23,630
Naruto...

923
01:03:25,670 --> 01:03:28,470
Sometimes your eyes are even better than
mine.

924
01:03:34,640 --> 01:03:36,140
Wherever he is...

925
01:03:39,620 --> 01:03:41,140
Sasuke is in the darkness.

926
01:03:51,440 --> 01:03:52,700
Now, get going!

927
01:03:53,860 --> 01:03:55,520
I'll be right behind you.

928
01:04:01,400 --> 01:04:02,400
Well, all right.

929
01:04:02,560 --> 01:04:03,620
Let's do this thing.

930
01:04:04,300 --> 01:04:07,280
When you catch up with us, make sure you
bring Choji, too.

931
01:04:08,800 --> 01:04:10,060
Of course I will.

932
01:04:18,210 --> 01:04:19,650
Oh, no you don't!

933
01:04:21,890 --> 01:04:22,890
Yakugan!

934
01:04:35,250 --> 01:04:36,330
He's pretty good.

935
01:04:36,450 --> 01:04:37,550
This is going to be fun.

936
01:04:41,230 --> 01:04:42,230
Thanks, Neji!

937
01:04:42,530 --> 01:04:44,030
Yep, that's him, all right.

938
01:04:46,930 --> 01:04:48,990
Well, that's just fine by me.

939
01:04:50,095 --> 01:04:53,250
Besides, you're by far the strongest one
of the lot.

940
01:05:00,080 --> 01:05:03,300
Okay, the game is I'll kill you in three
minutes or less.

941
01:05:03,301 --> 01:05:04,301
Yes.

942
01:05:41,040 --> 01:05:42,580
You're not going anywhere.

943
01:05:46,020 --> 01:05:49,760
For a wimp, you're pretty good at handling
chakra, aren't you?

944
01:05:50,060 --> 01:05:52,580
And those eyes of yours are pretty sharp.

945
01:05:54,580 --> 01:05:59,480
You fire off chakra from the chakra points
in your hands like a sharp needle.

946
01:05:59,760 --> 01:06:02,239
Then you target the thin
part of my thread with

947
01:06:02,240 --> 01:06:05,581
chakra running through
it and strike there.

948
01:06:05,840 --> 01:06:09,980
Yes, I heard this from Lord Orochimaru.

949
01:06:10,160 --> 01:06:13,460
It's the technique you call gentle fist,
right?

950
01:06:15,840 --> 01:06:18,729
But if you can't use those
annoying hands of yours,

951
01:06:18,730 --> 01:06:21,421
then you won't be able
to cut through my silk!

952
01:06:24,240 --> 01:06:26,300
That was way too easy.

953
01:06:26,380 --> 01:06:28,881
Once you figure out
your opponent's rules of

954
01:06:28,882 --> 01:06:32,121
engagement, games like this
one are no longer amusing.

955
01:06:32,400 --> 01:06:34,400
It's only been a minute or so.

956
01:06:34,401 --> 01:06:36,900
And I'm already tired of playing with you.

957
01:06:46,890 --> 01:06:47,890
Die!

958
01:07:12,300 --> 01:07:14,454
How did he.

959
01:07:23,164 --> 01:07:23,030
..?

960
01:07:24,490 --> 01:07:27,350
I suppose you want me to explain how I
broke free.

961
01:07:28,090 --> 01:07:30,550
You see, it's not just my hands.

962
01:07:31,050 --> 01:07:33,090
There are chakra points all over me.

963
01:07:33,190 --> 01:07:35,010
I can emit chakra from any one.

964
01:07:36,470 --> 01:07:39,990
And now, as you would say, game over.

965
01:07:44,220 --> 01:07:45,670
Gentle fist art.

966
01:07:46,140 --> 01:07:47,490
Eight trigrams.

967
01:07:47,491 --> 01:07:48,650
Sixty-four palms.

968
01:07:54,230 --> 01:07:56,030
Eight trigrams.

969
01:07:56,210 --> 01:07:57,570
Two palms.

970
01:08:00,100 --> 01:08:01,150
Four palms.

971
01:08:03,040 --> 01:08:04,040
Eight palms.

972
01:08:05,850 --> 01:08:07,090
Sixteen palms.

973
01:08:08,570 --> 01:08:09,450
Thirteen palms.

974
01:08:09,451 --> 01:08:10,451
Thirty-two palms.

975
01:08:11,390 --> 01:08:12,910
Sixty-four palms.

976
01:08:14,350 --> 01:08:19,420
Transient power art.

977
01:08:19,819 --> 01:08:20,819
encryption

978
01:08:34,480 --> 01:08:35,480
What's going on?

979
01:08:43,760 --> 01:08:46,000
The surface of his body?

980
01:08:46,001 --> 01:08:47,001
Ready.

981
01:09:11,040 --> 01:09:14,439
It's the same material as that weapon he
spit from his mouth.

982
01:09:16,240 --> 01:09:18,319
Well, well, that was close.

983
01:09:18,620 --> 01:09:21,708
I know if I take just one
direct hit from that gentle

984
01:09:21,709 --> 01:09:24,660
fist of yours, my whole chakra
network goes out of whack.

985
01:09:25,439 --> 01:09:27,300
You keep me on my toes, kid.

986
01:09:28,840 --> 01:09:33,260
That material... where does it come from,
you monster?

987
01:09:33,979 --> 01:09:35,060
Impressive, yes?

988
01:09:35,380 --> 01:09:38,636
My sticky spider thread
is actually a type of

989
01:09:38,637 --> 01:09:41,660
metal that hardens the
instant it leaves my body.

990
01:09:41,819 --> 01:09:43,620
It's impervious to chakra.

991
01:09:44,140 --> 01:09:48,469
And what's more, not only
can I secrete it from my mouth

992
01:09:48,470 --> 01:09:52,340
as you've seen, but from
every sweat gland in my body.

993
01:10:02,500 --> 01:10:03,640
That explains it.

994
01:10:03,840 --> 01:10:07,320
No wonder my attacks on his chakra points
have no effect.

995
01:10:07,580 --> 01:10:11,411
The spider web net won't
work on him, and close range

996
01:10:11,412 --> 01:10:14,560
combat is suicide against
that gentle fist of his.

997
01:10:14,900 --> 01:10:18,600
I'll just have to keep my distance and
look for a blind spot.

998
01:11:03,840 --> 01:11:04,890
The knife's just a ploy.

999
01:11:07,830 --> 01:11:11,550
Eight trigrams... rotation!

1000
01:11:21,290 --> 01:11:22,290
What the?

1001
01:11:22,330 --> 01:11:23,330
Impossible!

1002
01:11:32,470 --> 01:11:34,870
He... he repaired it.

1003
01:11:34,871 --> 01:11:36,391
He repelled my attack with his chakra.

1004
01:11:37,190 --> 01:11:38,190
But how?

1005
01:11:38,550 --> 01:11:39,990
How did he see it coming?

1006
01:11:40,990 --> 01:11:43,150
Does he have eyes in the back of his head?

1007
01:11:51,150 --> 01:11:52,150
No way!

1008
01:11:56,020 --> 01:11:57,550
Can he actually see me?

1009
01:12:00,100 --> 01:12:01,930
What kind of a freak is this guy?

1010
01:12:04,510 --> 01:12:05,510
I know you're there.

1011
01:12:06,670 --> 01:12:07,690
Come out!

1012
01:12:09,210 --> 01:12:10,210
It's those eyes.

1013
01:12:10,865 --> 01:12:13,410
The chakra flow's not the only thing they
can see.

1014
01:12:15,450 --> 01:12:18,330
The power of his visual jutsu is beyond
belief.

1015
01:12:20,060 --> 01:12:22,410
Long-distance combat is not to my
advantage.

1016
01:12:23,330 --> 01:12:24,990
I've got to get closer to him somehow.

1017
01:12:26,360 --> 01:12:27,360
Okay, then.

1018
01:12:31,930 --> 01:12:33,030
I give you credit.

1019
01:12:33,890 --> 01:12:37,450
You've made this game more of a challenge
than I thought it would be.

1020
01:12:38,710 --> 01:12:40,890
Time to start playing for real.

1021
01:12:45,640 --> 01:12:47,370
He's like a totally different opponent.

1022
01:12:47,770 --> 01:12:49,990
His chakra activity's staggering.

1023
01:12:51,690 --> 01:12:53,550
And those markings...

1024
01:13:02,030 --> 01:13:08,170
So, this guy is able to see me in the
dark, and to dodge an attack from behind.

1025
01:13:08,650 --> 01:13:13,250
In other words, he's got 360-degree X-ray
vision.

1026
01:13:13,490 --> 01:13:16,650
On top of that, there's that jutsu.

1027
01:13:18,210 --> 01:13:19,210
All right.

1028
01:13:24,490 --> 01:13:25,490
Summoning jutsu!

1029
01:13:40,430 --> 01:13:45,790
If he can block the physical attacks by
emitting lots of chakra and rotating...

1030
01:13:47,010 --> 01:13:50,090
Then all I have to do is stop that
rotation.

1031
01:13:52,970 --> 01:13:53,970
Scatter!

1032
01:14:05,410 --> 01:14:06,410
Rotation!

1033
01:14:14,550 --> 01:14:15,550
There.

1034
01:14:15,770 --> 01:14:17,070
That slowed him down.

1035
01:14:21,910 --> 01:14:22,910
Now!

1036
01:14:24,490 --> 01:14:26,010
Now you die!

1037
01:14:28,970 --> 01:14:30,730
The jutsu has been activated.

1038
01:14:37,970 --> 01:14:41,090
He slowed my dagger with Chakra at the
last second!

1039
01:14:46,470 --> 01:14:47,470
What?

1040
01:14:47,510 --> 01:14:49,230
His web stopped my rotation!

1041
01:14:49,570 --> 01:14:51,790
Our Chakra cancelled each other out!

1042
01:14:53,030 --> 01:14:54,050
Enough of this!

1043
01:14:55,610 --> 01:15:01,311
If my rotation jutsu won't work, I'll
just have to cut the threads one by one!

1044
01:15:02,030 --> 01:15:08,990
His strength is close-range taijutsu, so
as long as I keep my distance, I'm alright.

1045
01:15:09,970 --> 01:15:12,430
Just keep pounding away at him.

1046
01:15:12,490 --> 01:15:15,030
I've got all the time in the world.

1047
01:15:30,610 --> 01:15:31,610
Allright.

1048
01:15:43,710 --> 01:15:46,290
Eight Trigrams, 64 Pounds!

1049
01:15:54,510 --> 01:15:55,870
There's no end to them!

1050
01:16:06,760 --> 01:16:07,760
Huh?

1051
01:16:15,700 --> 01:16:17,200
He changed his stance.

1052
01:16:19,120 --> 01:16:20,240
Eight trigrams?

1053
01:16:20,500 --> 01:16:22,100
One hundred twenty-eight bombs!

1054
01:16:35,060 --> 01:16:36,060
What?

1055
01:16:36,120 --> 01:16:38,100
The number of blows has doubled!

1056
